ou</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Fabbro</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Pujol</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Guillot</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Acneiform eruption induced by epidermal growth factor receptor inhibitors in patients with solid tumours</article-title><source>Br J Dermatol</source><year>2004</year><volume>151</volume><fpage>238</fpage><lpage>241</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15270903</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2133.2004.06026.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B4"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Segaert</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Tabernero</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Chosidow</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Dirschka</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Elsner</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Mancini</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Maughan</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Morere</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><name><surname>Santoro</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Sobrero</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Van Cutsem</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Layton</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The management of skin reactions in cancer patients receiving epidermal growth factor receptor targeted therapies</article-title><source>J Dtsch Dermatol Ges</source><year>2005</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>599</fpage><lpage>606</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16033478</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1610-0387.2005.05058.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="a